  force: 'Two branches 26 m apart over the void: Moon throws through Sun''s hoop
    to drop his own drawbridge; Moon stands in the light to hold Sun''s gangway;
    Moon rides a shuttle longer than a fuse while Sun walks beside it, the bomb crossing
    both ways.'
